-- (c) Article 9(3) not met
#ASSERT `Under Article 17(3), as a controller, do paragraphs 1 and 2 not apply because the processing is necessary for reasons of public interest in the area of public health, in accordance with points (h) and (i) of Article 9(2) and Article 9(3)` TRUE `P2 controller answer: yes` `P2 controller answer: yes` `P2 controller answer: no` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (c) point (h) not met
#ASSERT `Under Article 17(3), as a controller, do paragraphs 1 and 2 not apply because the processing is necessary for reasons of public interest in the area of public health, in accordance with points (h) and (i) of Article 9(2) and Article 9(3)` TRUE `P2 controller answer: no` `P2 controller answer: yes` `P2 controller answer: yes` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (c) point (i) not met
#ASSERT `Under Article 17(3), as a controller, do paragraphs 1 and 2 not apply because the processing is necessary for reasons of public interest in the area of public health, in accordance with points (h) and (i) of Article 9(2) and Article 9(3)` TRUE `P2 controller answer: yes` `P2 controller answer: no` `P2 controller answer: yes` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (c) point (i) not decided, none failed: not covered
#ASSERT `Under Article 17(3), as a controller, do paragraphs 1 and 2 not apply because the processing is necessary for reasons of public interest in the area of public health, in accordance with points (h) and (i) of Article 9(2) and Article 9(3)` TRUE `P2 controller answer: yes` `P2 controller answer: not sure` `P2 controller answer: yes` EQUALS NOTHING
-- (c) point (h) fails: fails whatever (i) is
#ASSERT `Under Article 17(3), as a controller, do paragraphs 1 and 2 not apply because the processing is necessary for reasons of public interest in the area of public health, in accordance with points (h) and (i) of Article 9(2) and Article 9(3)` TRUE `P2 controller answer: no` `P2 controller answer: not sure` `P2 controller answer: yes` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (c) not necessary for public health reasons
#ASSERT `Under Article 17(3), as a controller, do paragraphs 1 and 2 not apply because the processing is necessary for reasons of public interest in the area of public health, in accordance with points (h) and (i) of Article 9(2) and Article 9(3)` FALSE `P2 controller answer: yes` `P2 controller answer: yes` `P2 controller answer: yes` EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- 17(3)(d): Art 17(3)(d) paragraphs 1 and 2 do not apply to the extent that processing is necessary for archiving, research or statistical purposes
-- (d) archiving, research or statistical purposes in accordance with Article 89(1), and the right is likely to render impossible or seriously impair the objectives
#ASSERT `Under Article 17(3), as a controller, do paragraphs 1 and 2 not apply because the processing is necessary for archiving, research or statistical purposes, in accordance with Article 89(1) and in so far as erasure would seriously impair its objectives` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (d) not in accordance with Article 89(1)
#ASSERT `Under Article 17(3), as a controller, do paragraphs 1 and 2 not apply because the processing is necessary for archiving, research or statistical purposes, in accordance with Article 89(1) and in so far as erasure would seriously impair its objectives` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (d) the right would not impair the objectives: 'in so far as' fails
#ASSERT `Under Article 17(3), as a controller, do paragraphs 1 and 2 not apply because the processing is necessary for archiving, research or statistical purposes, in accordance with Article 89(1) and in so far as erasure would seriously impair its objectives` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (d) not for those purposes
#ASSERT `Under Article 17(3), as a controller, do paragraphs 1 and 2 not apply because the processing is necessary for archiving, research or statistical purposes, in accordance with Article 89(1) and in so far as erasure would seriously impair its objectives` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- 17(3)(e): Art 17(3)(e) paragraphs 1 and 2 do not apply to the extent that processing is necessary for the establishment, exercise or defence of legal claims
-- (e) legal claims
