-- no exception holds
#ASSERT `Under Article 17(3), as a controller, do paragraphs 1 and 2 not apply to the personal data I process` `P2 controller answer: no` `P2 controller answer: no` `P2 controller answer: no` `P2 controller answer: no` `P2 controller answer: no` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- no exception holds and (e) is not decided
